      "content": "therapists just tell you things to make you feel better so you can keep going, but i don't want to keep going. it just feels like i'm performing. staying here feels so unnatural. it's like i'm a limb that's been severed and i'm just... hovering there, waiting to catch up to the rest of him. it's so heavy being alive right now.",
